    "Hide more files from the project navigator. `*.o` matches names anywhere; `build/` matches folders only; a pattern with `/` inside, like `docs/*.png`, matches paths from the project root. Search and Open Quickly are not affected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在项目导航器中隐藏更多文件。`*.o` 匹配任意位置的名称；`build/` 仅匹配文件夹；中间包含 `/` 的模式（如 `docs/*.png`）匹配相对于项目根目录的路径。搜索和“快速打开”不受影响。"
