          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first folder with a CMakeLists.txt among the workspace root, src, cpp, native, linux, windows, macos and packages/*/src is active unless you pick another. The C++ section and clangd use the active root's presets and compilation database." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在工作区根目录、src、cpp、native、linux、windows、macos 和 packages/*/src 中，第一个包含 CMakeLists.txt 的文件夹为当前根目录，除非您另选其他文件夹。C++ 部分和 clangd 会使用当前根目录的预设和编译数据库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The gutter displays line numbers and code folding regions." : {
